|----------------|----------|-------------------|
| Port `3000` | Medium | `PORT` |
| User/mock data | Medium | `DATABASE_URL` (fetch from DB) |
| Bind address (implicit) | Low | `HOST` |
| No environment mode | Low | `NODE_ENV` |

